1
00:00:00,319 --> 00:00:01,579
(Sheldon:)Why would you do that?

2
00:00:01,773 --> 00:00:03,473
(Amy:)This was a potential issue,

3
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:05,205
(Amy:)so I got out ahead of it

4
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:07,980
(Amy:)and I managed
the situation for you.

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:11,550
You "managed the situation."

6
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,750
(Amy:)That's right.

7
00:00:12,751 --> 00:00:15,681
(Sheldon:)So my mother thought I was
incapable of finding a mate,

8
00:00:15,687 --> 00:00:18,987
(Sheldon:)and my mate thinks I'm incapable
of running my own life.

9
00:00:18,991 --> 00:00:21,061
Not your whole life!

10
00:00:21,059 --> 00:00:22,889
(Amy:)I mean, science.
You got that.

11
00:00:22,894 --> 00:00:25,494
(Amy:)Organizing your sock drawer,
you're the king.

12
00:00:26,531 --> 00:00:29,331
(Amy:)But understanding
how other people are feeling,

13
00:00:29,334 --> 00:00:31,364
(Amy:)that's a weak spot for you.

14
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,940
(Sheldon:)I have gotten
much better at that.

15
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:36,378
(Amy:)Have you?
How am I feeling right now?

16
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,545
What the... How should I know?

17
00:00:39,478 --> 00:00:42,848
(Sheldon:)Excited? Itchy?
Give me the first letter.

18
00:00:42,848 --> 00:00:45,918
(Amy:)You and I are in
a relationship.

19
00:00:45,917 --> 00:00:47,887
(Amy:)I help you with
your shortcomings,

20
00:00:47,886 --> 00:00:50,116
(Amy:)and you help me with mine.

21
00:00:50,122 --> 00:00:51,722
(Sheldon:)How would you feel
if I contacted

22
00:00:51,723 --> 00:00:53,393
(Sheldon:)your mother behind your back?

23
00:00:53,392 --> 00:00:57,262
(Amy:)Delighted that you showed any
interest in my family at all?

24
00:00:57,262 --> 00:00:58,692
"Delighted"?

25
00:00:58,697 --> 00:01:03,027
(Sheldon:)What... Not if I guessed
for a hundred years.

